A set of experiments and explorations, mostly using the [regl](https://github.com/regl-project/regl) WebGL library, some computed on the GPU and some on the CPU. Sketches below are grouped for **VM-friendly** viewing versus **GPU-heavy WebGL**; style tags mirror the [Radiant](https://github.com/pbakaus/radiant) gallery vocabulary (submodule at `radiant/`). The source for all content and projects on this site can be found [here](https://github.com/rreusser/rreusser.github.io/tree/master/src/src).

Comments? Questions? Let me know [@rreusser@mathstodon.xyz](https://mathstodon.xyz/@rreusser).

